OL,3,GNEWSANew hope for breast cancer
OL,4,Apatients as life-extending drug now on
OL,5,ANHS in England
OL,6,
OL,7,FPatients in England with a specific
OL,8,Ftype of incurable breast cancer can now
OL,9,Faccess a life-extending drug on the
OL,10,FNHS, two years after it was deemed too
OL,11,Fexpensive by a health body.
OL,13,FEnhertu can give patients almost seven
OL,14,Fextra months to live on average - with
OL,15,Fsome living up to three years longer.
OL,17,FWomen in Scotland have had access to
OL,18,Fthe drug on the NHS since 2023, and it
OL,19,Fis available in 26 other European
OL,20,Fcountries.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
