OL,3,GNEWSANew hope for breast cancer
OL,4,Apatients as life-extending drug now on
OL,5,ANHS in England
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharities and patients have campaigned
OL,8,Ffor it to be more widely available
OL,9,Fsince 2024, when the National Institute
OL,10,Ffor Health and Care Excellence (NICE)
OL,11,Fsaid Enhertu was not good value for
OL,12,Fmoney.
